r4,1,2,4
l,2,0,1,2
r12,2,0,12

analysis: tr
note: Second interval in TR with the source at zero: il, vl and ir4 all decay as e^(-3t).
image: https://learn.symbulator.com/assets/practice/bo2s-drill-exercise-5-3-9.jpg
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


[Bo2's p230 (Dependent source)]

r,v,0,r
j,v,0,2*ir
l,v,0,l,5

